            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28infinity%2C1%29-algebraic+theory"}> higher
            )
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebra+over+an+algebraic+theory"} algebras
            this duality relates
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+geometry"} higher geometry
            with
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+algebra"} higher algebra
          %p
            Objects preserved by the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monad"} monad
            of this adjunction are called
            = succeed "." do
              %strong Isbell self-dual
          %p
