          .num_remark
            %h6#remark_2 Remark
            %p
              Here apart from writing out or hiding the ends, the only step that is not a definition is precisely the middle one, where we used that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
