          %h2#references References
          %p
            The original articles on Isbell duality and the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Isbell+envelope"} Isbell envelope
            are
          %ul
            %li#Isbell66
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Isbell"}> John Isbell
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Structure of categories
                %strong 72
                (1966), 619-655. &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://projecteuclid.org/euclid.bams/1183528163"}> euclid:1183528163
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.ams.org/journals/bull/1966-72-04/S0002-9904-1966-11541-0/"} ams:1966-72-04/S0002-9904-1966-11541-0
            %li#Isbell67
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Isbell"}> John Isbell
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Normal completions of categories
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 47
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BFb0074302"} doi:10.1007/BFb0074302
            %li#Kock66
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Anders+Kock"}> Anders Kock
                \.
                = succeed "." do
                  %em Continuous Yoneda representation of a small category
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://tildeweb.au.dk/au76680/CYRSC.pdf"} pdf
          %p More recent discussion:
          %ul
            %li#Lawvere86
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/William+Lawvere"}> William Lawvere
                , p. 17 of
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Taking categories seriously
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://tac.mta.ca/tac/reprints/articles/8/tr8abs.html"} web
            %li#BKR08
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Barr"}> Michael Barr
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Kennison"} John Kennison
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+Raphael"} Robert Raphael
                %em Isbell Duality
                Theory and Applications of Categories
                %strong 20
                15 (2008) 504-542 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/volumes/20/15/20-15abs.html"}> tac:20-15
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Barr"}> Michael Barr
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Kennison"} John Kennison
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+Raphael"} Robert Raphael
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Isbell duality for modules
                %strong 22
                17 (2009) 401-419 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/volumes/22/17/22-17abs.html"}> tac:22-17
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.math.mcgill.ca/barr/papers/rmod.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Richard+Garner"}> Richard Garner
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The Isbell monad
                %strong 274
                (2015) pp.516-537. (
                %a{:href => "http://comp.mq.edu.au/~rgarner/Papers/Isbell.pdf"}> draft
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vaughan+Pratt"}> Vaughan Pratt
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Communes via Yoneda, from an elementary perspective
            %li#DL19
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ivan+Di+Liberti"}> Ivan Di Liberti
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Fosco+Loregian"} Fosco Loregian
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On the Unicity of Formal Category Theories
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1901.01594"} abstract
            %li#DiLiberti
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ivan+Di+Liberti"}> Ivan Di Liberti
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Codensity: Isbell duality, pro-objects, compactness and accessibility
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1910.01014"} arXiv:1910.01014
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tom+Avery"}> Tom Avery
                ,
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tom+Leinster"} Tom Leinster
                = succeed "." do
                  %em Isbell conjugacy and the reflexive completion
                %strong 36
                12 (2021) 306-347 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/volumes/36/12/36-12abs.html"}> tac:36-12
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/volumes/36/12/36-12.pdf"} pdf
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (relation to
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/reflexive+completion"} reflexive completion
            %li#Baez22
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Baez"}> John Baez
                , Isbell duality,
                %em Notices Amer. Math. Soc.
                %strong 70
                (2022) 140-141 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1090/noti2602"}> doi:10.1090/noti2602
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.ams.org/journals/notices/202301/rnoti-p140.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            Isbell conjugacy for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-presheaves"} (∞,1)-presheaves
            over the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-category"} (∞,1)-category
            of duals of
            = succeed "s" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dg-algebra"} dg-algebra
          %ul#Ben-ZviNadler
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Ben-Zvi"}> David Ben-Zvi
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Nadler"} David Nadler
              %em Loop spaces and connections
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1002.3636"}> arXiv:1002.3636
              )
          %p in
          %ul
            %li#Toen
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bertrand+To%C3%ABn"}> Bertrand Toën
              ,
              %em Champs affines
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0012219"}> arXiv:math/0012219
              )
          %p
            Isbell self-dual
            = succeed "s" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%E2%88%9E-stack"} ∞-stack
            = succeed "s" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/associative+algebra"} associative algebra
            = succeed "." do
              %em affine stacks
            %em small
            in a sense and local with respect to the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohomology"} cohomology
            with coefficients in the canonical
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/line+object"} line object
          %p
            A generalization of this latter to
            = succeed "-stacks" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mn ∞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \infty
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebra+over+a+Lawvere+theory"} algebras over arbitrary abelian Lawvere theories
            is the content of
          %ul
            %li#Stel
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Herman+Stel"}> Herman Stel
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mn ∞
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \infty
                  \-Stacks and their function algebras – with applications to
                  = succeed "-Lie" do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mn ∞
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \infty
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/master+thesis+Stel"} web
